 "text": "Hello, how's everything with you? Not weird at all, it's great way to get outdoors and eat healthy. Do you want spot near someone else, or would you rather be all to yourself? Sure thing. How's life treating you? It varies wildly. Some people give very little, others quite a lot. Giving with friends can help. If you all agree to contribute a set amount, it makes it more social. Fair enough. Then think about how much you'd be happy to spend on a weekend getaway. Pick a park near one and give that.",
